WEBVTT

00:00:06.045 --> 00:00:12.045
Choose Users in the side menu.

00:00:13.762 --> 00:00:19.762
Type "adaeze" in the Search
by email or profile name box.

00:00:21.845 --> 00:00:27.095
Click Search.

00:00:27.345 --> 00:00:33.345
Click adaeze@example.test
to open the account.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.734
Scroll to Signed in on.

00:00:38.984 --> 00:00:43.745
Click Sign out everywhere.

00:00:43.995 --> 00:00:49.995
Type "Phone was lost" in the Reason box.

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:56.367
Click Sign out everywhere to confirm.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:02.903
Click Suspend account.

00:01:03.153 --> 00:01:09.153
Type "Shared the account"
in the Reason box.

00:01:09.927 --> 00:01:15.927
Click Suspend account to confirm.

00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:24.033
Click Reinstate account.

00:01:25.554 --> 00:01:31.554
Click Reinstate account to confirm.
